('2024:ball-bearings', '2024', 'Ball bearings', 'gear', 'Adventuring Gear', null, false, 100, 2, null, null, 'As a Utilize action, you can spill Ball Bearings from their pouch. They spread to cover a level, 10-footsquare area within 10 feet of yourself. A creature that enters this area for the first time on a turn must succeed on a DC 10 Dexterity saving throw or have the Prone condition. It takes 10 minutes to recover the Ball Bearings.', null),
