('2024:spikes-iron', '2024', 'Spikes, Iron', 'gear', 'Adventuring Gear', null, false, 100, 2, null, null, 'Iron Spikes come in bundles of ten. As a Utilize action, you can use a blunt object, such as a Light Hammer, to hammer a spike into wood, earth, or a similar material. You can do so to jam a door shut or to then tie a Rope or Chain to the Spike.', null),
